<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Tweefontein year share, dividend rise.</title>
<headline>Tweefontein year share, dividend rise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     852.8	 vs 448.9</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 852.0	 vs 448.0</p>
<p>    Net income		14.79	 vs 7.78</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   14.09	 vs 7.79</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.01	  vs 0.01</p>
<p>    Interest income	 0.03	  vs 0.02</p>
<p>Div payable November 27</p>
<p>on register November 15</p>
<p>Full name: Tweefontein United Collieries Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm's main investment is a stake of 31.9 million shares in Duiker Mininbg Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
